   "k": "18trnpq",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ was a new nation formed after the First Balkan War. It was previously part of the ⟦1⟧. Its most notable leader was Ahmet Muhtar Zogolli, better known as King Zog. His title was, at first, Prime Minister, then President, and finally King. He ruled for 17 years. The Italian invasion and subsequent annexation of Albania ended his rule. Albania and ⟦2⟧ would end up being the only countries ⟦3⟧ would manage to defeat by itself.",
